{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Mn9D6dbfDz1793230019.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>江西銅業截至九月底止季度按年多賺六成半，純利超過30億元人民幣，扣除非經常性損益純利26.82億元人民幣，增長四成。主要由於公司持續強化經營管理，提升資源綜合利用效率，加上主產品價格上升。</p><p></p><p>期內收入跌近百分之3，至1,352億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:54.010926+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:14.313728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:18:13.309673+00:00","content_hash":"44d80f56e75b75099da10161897c054d78099254161e0c2bb06261855656bfc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:54.010926+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}